// Fortification ([CR#205.3g], [CR#301.6]) — an artifact subtype that can be
// attached only to a land. Under default-deny attachment, being attachable to a
// land is a GRANT the subtype confers: `May(Attach(to: Land))`. The grant is a
// rule of the SUBTYPE, not a removable card ability, so it is conferred `Innate`
// (survives "loses all abilities"); `attachment_legal` reads the `May(Attach)`
// generically (no engine subtype branch). The fortify ACTIVATED ability rides
// the Fortify keyword, not the subtype.
//
// Authored directly as a `Subtype` (not via the `ArtifactType` meta-macro)
// because this artifact subtype carries a `confers:` list.
(
    name: "Fortification",
    kinds: [Subtype],
    body: Subtype(
        name: "Fortification",
        types: [Artifact],
        confers: [
            Ability(Innate(Static(May(Attach(what: Ref(This), to: Type(Land)))))),
        ],
    ),
)
